cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PTU-Net, cite the software version or commit that you used.
title: PTU-Net
type: software
authors:
  - name: PTU-Net contributors
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: https://github.com/ExploreXploitQ/PTU-Net
url: https://github.com/ExploreXploitQ/PTU-Net
abstract: >-
  PTU-Net is research software for patch-based temporal reconstruction of
  compressed two-dimensional scientific fields using a transformer correction
  path and a gated U-Net refinement head.
keywords:
  - scientific machine learning
  - lossy compression
  - temporal reconstruction
  - transformer
  - U-Net
